# w3id.org permanent identifier: https://w3id.org/asb
# ASB (Agentic Science Builder) vocabularies, Holobiomics Lab (CNRS / Universite Cote d'Azur).
#   https://w3id.org/asb#…             ASB vocabulary terms
#   https://w3id.org/asb/validation#…  validation assertion terms
#   https://w3id.org/asb/indicium-ext#… ASB workflow-characterisation extension terms
# The documents are served by holobiomicslab.cnrs.fr, which answers each by content
# negotiation (303 to HTML, Turtle, JSON-LD or RDF/XML); the Accept header is
# passed on unchanged by the redirect below.
# Maintainer: https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skill-collections

Options -MultiViews
RewriteEngine On

RewriteRule ^validation/?$ https://holobiomicslab.cnrs.fr/ns/asbval [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^indicium-ext/?$ https://holobiomicslab.cnrs.fr/ns/asb-indicium-ext [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^$ https://holobiomicslab.cnrs.fr/ns/asb [R=303,L]
